<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's Arrieta in Iran for oil conference.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's Arrieta in Iran for oil conference.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's Energy and Mines Minister Erwin Arrieta will speak at an oil conference during his trip to fellow OPEC-member Iran this week, the Energy and Mines Ministry said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>He will also attend a meeting of OPEC's production monitoring sub-committee while in the country.</p>
<p>The statement said the &quot;Middle East Oil and Gas towards the Third Millenium&quot; conference held in Isfahan would give Arrieta the opportunity to expound his theory on reorganising the world petroleum map according to regional blocks.</p>
<p>((--Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
